---
import MaterialIcon from '../MaterialIcon.astro';
---

<section class="relative isolate min-h-192 overflow-hidden bg-[#111013] text-white sm:min-h-216 lg:min-h-248" aria-labelledby="tv-results-title">
  <img height="863" width="1823" decoding="async"
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-30 size-full object-cover object-center"
    src="/img/inicio/tv-streaming-resultados.avif"
    alt="Equipo profesional operando una transmisión de televisión en directo"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-[#111013]/70"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-linear-to-b from-[#111013]/20 via-transparent to-[#111013]/80"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto flex min-h-192 w-[min(100%-2rem,118rem)] flex-col px-2 py-14 sm:min-h-216 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:min-h-248 lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p data-section-kicker class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3 text-(--h-blanco)">
        <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#03b99a]"></span>
        Streaming de televisión
      </p>
      <h2 id="tv-results-title" class="text-[clamp(4rem,9vw,10rem)] leading-[.85] tracking-[-.065em] text-[var(--h-blanco)]">
        Resultados reales<span class="text-[#03b99a]">.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-auto grid gap-12 pt-32 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.25fr] lg:items-end lg:gap-24">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-8 h-px w-full max-w-md bg-white/65"></div>
        <p class="max-w-md font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--h-blanco)] sm:text-lg">
          Transmisión estable para canales, productoras, eventos y medios digitales con distribución adaptable a cualquier audiencia.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-12 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-[clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem)] font-light leading-[.75] tracking-[-.065em] text-[var(--h-blanco)]">99.9%</p>
        <p class="mt-7 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm text-[var(--h-blanco)]">Disponibilidad garantizada para tus emisiones</p>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="max-w-4xl lg:justify-self-end">
        <div class="mb-8 grid size-20 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm sm:size-24">
          <MaterialIcon name="ic:outline-cell-tower" size={56} class="size-11 text-[var(--h-blanco)] sm:size-14" />
        </div>
        <p class="font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.1vw,3.8rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.18] tracking-[-.035em] text-[var(--h-blanco)]">
          “Nuestra señal permanece estable, rápida y disponible para la audiencia en todo momento<span class="text-[#03b99a]">.</span>”
        </p>
        <footer class="mt-8 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm text-[var(--h-blanco)] sm:text-base">
          Canales y productores conectados con Servistream.
          <a class="ml-1 border-b border-white/50 pb-1 text-[var(--h-blanco)] transition-colors hover:border-[#03b99a] hover:text-[#03b99a]" href="/tv-streaming">Conocer TV Streaming</a>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
